    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3490" root="بوأ" body-key="b">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَائِىٌّ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَاوِيٌّ</span></b>  rel. ns. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَآءٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَا</span> the names of
the letter <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ب</span>; (TA in <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">باب الالف الليّنة</span>;) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَيَوِىٌّ</span></b> 
is a rel. n. of the same. (M in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ب</span>.)

